<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  /* Basic styling to mimic document structure */
  body { font-family: "Liberation Serif", "DejaVu Serif", Georgia, serif; }
  h1 { text-align: center; font-size: 24pt; margin-bottom: 5px; }
  h2 { font-size: 14pt; margin-top: 20px; }
  .form-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 15px; }
  .form-label { width: 150px; text-align: left; }
  .form-input-area { flex-grow: 1; border-bottom: 1px solid #000; }
  .signature-line { margin-top: 50px; }
  .footer { text-align: center; margin-top: 50px; font-size: 10pt; }
</style>

<div class="page">
  <h1>ADELPHI UNIVERSITY</h1>
  <h2>Adelphi University Meal Plan Reduction Request Form - Religious Dietary Restriction</h2>
  <p>Students must submit this form to request a meal plan reduction based on the student's religion, to Adelphi University Auxiliary Services in person, by mail, or by email. Adelphi University reserves the right to require additional information and/or documentation deemed necessary to review this request.</p>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div class="form-label">Student's Name (Print):</div>
    <div class="form-input-area"><span data-field="full_name">{{ full_name }}</span></div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div class="form-label">Last:</div>
    <div class="form-input-area"><span data-field="last_name">{{ last_name }}</span></div>
    <div class="form-label" style="margin-left: 30px;">First:</div>
    <div class="form-input-area"><span data-field="first_name">{{ first_name }}</span></div>
    <div class="form-label" style="margin-left: 30px;">MI:</div>
    <div class="form-input-area"><span data-field="middle_initial">{{ middle_initial }}</span></div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div class="form-label">Student's Signature:</div>
    <div class="form-input-area"><span data-field="signature">{{ signature }}</span></div>
    <div class="form-label" style="margin-left: 30px;">Class Yr:</div>
    <div class="form-input-area"><span data-field="class_year">{{ class_year }}</span></div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div class="form-label">Student's ID#:</div>
    <div class="form-input-area"><span data-field="student_id">{{ student_id }}</span></div>
    <div class="form-label" style="margin-left: 30px;">Date:</div>
    <div class="form-input-area"><span data-field="date_submitted">{{ date_submitted }}</span></div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div class="form-label">Address:</div>
    <div class="form-input-area"><span data-field="address">{{ address }}</span></div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div class="form-label">Email address:</div>
    <div class="form-input-area"><span data-field="email_address">{{ email_address }}</span></div>
    <div class="form-label" style="margin-left: 30px;">Telephone:</div>
    <div class="form-input-area"><span data-field="phone_number">{{ phone_number }}</span></div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
    <div class="form-label" style="width: 100%;">A statement as to why Adelphi University Dining Services cannot meet your religious dietary needs as well as any additional information you wish to provide in support of your request:</div>
    <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; margin-top: 5px; height: 100px;">
      <!-- Placeholder for large text area -->
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; margin-top: 5px; height: 50px;" data-field="field_1">{{ field_1 }}</div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; margin-top: 5px; height: 50px;" data-field="field_2">{{ field_2 }}</div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; margin-top: 5px; height: 50px;" data-field="field_3">{{ field_3 }}</div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 50px;">
    <p>This form must be filled out and submitted with supporting documentation, if any is required, to:</p>
    <p>Adelphi University Auxiliary and Event Services</p>
    <p><span data-field="university_center_room">{{ university_center_room }}</span></p>
    <p><span data-field="street_address">{{ street_address }}</span></p>
    <p><span data-field="city_state_zip">{{ city_state_zip }}</span></p>
    <p><span data-field="auxiliary_email">{{ auxiliary_email }}</span></p>
  </div>

  <div class="footer">
    7
  </div>
</div>